  "front": "State the continuity equation and the physical principle behind it.",
  "back": "A_1 v_1 = A_2 v_2, on the equation sheet. It expresses conservation of mass flow rate: in an incompressible fluid filling a pipe, whatever enters per second must leave per second because nothing can accumulate."
