    "Stated $a_T = r\\alpha$ and that it stays constant while $\\alpha$ is constant",
    "Stated $a_c = \\omega^2 r$ (or $v^2/r$) and that it starts at zero and grows as the square of the angular velocity",
    "Assigned the correct job to each: tangential changes speed, centripetal changes direction",
