    "Obtained $v_{\\max} = 1.2$ m/s by setting the total equal to $\\tfrac{1}{2}mv^2$ at equilibrium",
    "Computed $U_s$ at $x = 0.090$ m and subtracted it from the total to get $K$, rather than attempting a kinematics route",
    "Obtained $v = 0.96$ m/s with units",
