      "q": "Under what change WOULD the hanging spring's period differ from the horizontal one's?",
      "a": "None that gravity supplies. It would differ only if $m$ or $k$ changed — for instance if a real spring's mass were significant, which the exam's ideal-spring convention lets you ignore unless told otherwise."
