  "unit": "u2",
  "stem": "Two blocks sit touching each other on a frictionless horizontal floor. Block A has mass 2.0 kg and block B has mass 4.0 kg. A horizontal force of 12 N is applied to block A, pushing it against block B. What is the magnitude of the force that A exerts on B?",
