  "unit": "u3",
  "stem": "A force acting along the direction of motion of a 2.0 kg cart varies with position: it is constant at 8.0 N from $x = 0$ to $x = 2.0$ m, then falls linearly to 0 N at $x = 4.0$ m. How much work does it do over the full 4.0 m?",
